From d3317d752c2fa017849d91b9b819857c4baca8af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JimmyBlunt <jo@paso-music.de>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 01:26:56 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 07/15] Keep FastLED Patterns away from Controllers, Shows and
 the agent (local #9002)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

DESIGN.md §7: one helper (isFastLedSource) wherever C++ could reach a
Pixelblaze path, so a FastLED Pattern is never sent to a Controller and
nothing crashes on one.

- Send to Controller: Pattern subjects now honour deliveryBlocker in
  describeControllerActionRow; a FastLED Pattern disables Run and Save
  with "FastLED Patterns run in PXLBLZ-IDE only; output goes through the
  LED router". pushActivePattern refuses FastLED source (defence in depth).
- Background saved-artifact reconciliation and Controller saved-program
  matching/import skip FastLED Patterns.
- Show pickers (v1 editor options, v2 timeline source choices) omit
  FastLED Patterns; compileShowForPreview (Stage, delivery, export, agent)
  and the v2 prepared stage refuse an existing FastLED member with an
  explicit message (engine/showFastLedGuard.ts); automatable-control
  discovery returns none for C++.
- Agent discovery/editorAdmission skip FastLED Patterns, so one C++ source
  no longer makes discovery return nothing for every Pattern.

Pre-commit hook checks run manually (hook cannot spawn npx.cmd on Windows/Node 24):
npm run lint, check:e2e-coverage, check:e2e-locators, tsc -b (tsconfig + node),
vitest controllerStore + controllerActionRow (engine + component) +
editorAdmission.discovery + agentDiscovery + showFastLedGuard +
showPreviewArtifact + showPreparedStageV2 + showV2TimelineEditorModel +
showPatternControls (all passed).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
